  "notes": "USAGE:\nThis is a literary/formal verb. In everyday speech, {出|だ}す is more common for sense 1, and {出|だ}す or {発表|はっぴょう}する for sense 2. {発|はっ}する appears frequently in news, academic writing, and formal contexts.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {光|ひかり}を{発|はっ}する: to emit light\n- {熱|ねつ}を{発|はっ}する: to give off heat\n- {声明|せいめい}を{発|はっ}する: to issue a statement\n- {命令|めいれい}を{発|はっ}する: to issue an order\n- {警報|けいほう}を{発|はっ}する: to issue a warning\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- {放|はな}つ: to release, to emit (also literary, but emphasizes sending outward)\n- {出|だ}す: to put out, to produce (everyday equivalent)",
